abstract: >-
  Code and released data for a study of label leakage in text classification of regulated status,
  using Indian YouTube channels linked to the public SEBI registers of Investment Advisers and Research Analysts.
keywords:
  - finfluencers
  - label leakage
  - positive-unlabelled learning
  - text classification
  - SEBI register
